// =====================================================================
// [CLEARING]  Limit-of-disturbance clearing + Lego-style silt fence.
//   · Staking a LOD loop clears everything inside it — trees, brush, rocks, stumps, logs — except a buffer around
//     the pond (its trees stay: the pond gets silt fence, not a bulldozer) and a strip around the office yard.
//     Trees topple in a sweeping wave. Dozer.machine() is the hook for a real bulldozer animation (not built yet).
//   · Reporting a finished silt-fence layout to Justin builds the fence along it, brick by brick. It's knee-high
//     (the jump clears it easily) and vehicles just roll through.
//   Both are world state the crew lead rides in presence (`fx`), so helpers see them go up too.
// =====================================================================
