// =====================================================================
// [INV]  Inventory (Tab on PC, backpack button at the end of the hotbar). Minecraft / 7 Days style.
//        Hotbar = 6 slots: 1 bare hands, 2 the RTK rover rod (both fixed), then 4 open slots that fill
//        with whatever you pick up (lath, pin flags, nails, shotguns, pistol, drinks, Zyn). No room?
//        It goes in the 12-slot backpack. Drag (or click-click) items to move them around — in the
//        inventory and right on the hotbar. Containers (job box, break-room table) open a loot panel:
//        pick an item, set how many, drop it in the slot you want.
