// =====================================================================
// [OSHA]  An OSHA inspector walks the site on a slow patrol (same route + timing for the whole crew),
//         looking around with a vision cone painted on the ground. Catch his eye with tools out or on
//         a job without full PPE (outside the office yard): suspicion builds ("?" → "!"), then he
//         blows his whistle — "HEY! STOP!" — and you're sent back to the main office: tools go back
